{
  "_id": 23057,
  "id": "welcome_to_the_cosmic_city",
  "name": "Welcome to the Cosmic City",
  "desc": "Above the city, a girl's flamboyant figure bursts free from the teleporter.\nEndless streams of traffic, countless silhouettes of people... the bustle carries on as always.\n\"Sure looks lively, but...\"\n\nThe screen before her lights up as people's joys and sorrows transform into specks of light, flowing into it.\n\"Even the NPCs' fatigue gauges are about to max out...\"\n\"No way I'm playing a raid this boring.\"\n\nFollowing the swipe of her finger, the city lights flicker on and off.\nFrom an unnoticed corner comes a startled cry, followed by thunderous cheers echoing through the sky.\n\"All players' Luck doubled, randomized special talents, rewards maxed out...\"\n\"Game loaded successfully! Time to run the show!\"\n\nThe girl leaps down as familiar notification sounds ring in her ears.\nHer game time has begun.",
  "rarity": 5,
  "pathType": "Elation",
  "pathTypeText": "Elation",
  "effectName": "Guaranteed Victory",
  "effectTemplate": "Increases the wearer's SPD by <color=#f29e38ff>#1[i]%</color>. The Elation DMG dealt ignores <color=#f29e38ff>#2[i]%</color> of the target's DEF. When the wearer uses Ultimate on themselves, gains <color=#f29e38ff>#3[i]</color> point(s) of \"Punchline.\" This effect can be triggered up to 1 time. And resets this trigger count after using Basic ATK #4[i] time(s).",
